{"title":"What should I ask Henry Oliver?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/939592628/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Henry-Oliver.html","date":1767374946000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  We will focus on our mutual readings of Shakespearer’s <em>Measure for Measure</em>, with Henry taking the lead.  But I also will ask him about the value of literature, Jane Austen, Adam Smith, Bleak House, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Second-Act-Bloomers-Success-Reinventing/dp/1399813323/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2MJUTVTCBZJ7Y&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.ypQvfy-Ui3kZ63Ep3qAayMd8P3RiHex8n4AGO5ZdjqFQe9K7CggK79QKNAnLRqZmswTj4ECnZkx8GeXpLqOdSI_y1XOr8-kGhVE9IPb8DCPG8-HnaZhjv7LqtjHmy133.j8EuGBDDidbPT78WFHJAfziv746ZePL6W7FOIPPv9Ng&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=henry+oliver+second+act&amp;qid=1767360481&amp;sprefix=henry+oliver%2Caps%2C140&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">his book on late bloomers</a>, and more.</p>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.commonreader.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Henry’s (free) Substack</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/HenryEOliver\" target=\"_blank\">Henry on Twitter</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/what-should-i-ask-henry-oliver.html\">What should I ask Henry Oliver?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/939592628/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/939592628/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/